==German==

===Etymology===
Old High German ''[[argerōn]]''

===Verb===
'''ärgern'''

# {{transitive|lang=de}} to [[annoy]], to [[make]] [[angry]]
#: ''Die anderen Kinder '''ärgern''' ihn immer.'' - The other kids keep vexing him.
# {{reflexive|lang=de}} to [[be]] [[annoyed]], to [[be]] [[angry]], to [[get]] [[annoyed]], to [[get]] [[angry]]

